@module cells ; The cells under Rex: ladders, restart markers, the conveyor, the shield recharger, the weapon stations
$9545 c CellsUnderRex ; Test the cells under Rex and act: the lift ($12), the restart marker (7), the conveyor (9: Rex one pixel left), the recharger (8, up to 99), the weapon stations ($0A-$0D, each with its panel)
