$95AC StationLaser ; the laser station
$95BB StationMultiple ; the multiple station
$95CA StationSpray ; The spray station ($0C): GiveSpray $A271 and the SPRAY panel (SprayText $A6E5)
$95D9 Recharge ; The recharger ($08): ShieldEnergy + 1 up to 99 while the shield is off, the recharge sound
@module tutor ; The Tutor Mode: each room's set-up, the panels at their frames, the input scripts, the room list
@about DEMO plays rooms 4, 1, 0 and 2 (TutorRooms $A2A2) with Rex driven by an input script (TutorStep $9F82: [input][count] pairs; the key tests TutorKeyFire to TutorKeyShield read TutorInput $6079). Each room's tutor (TutorRoom0-4) puts Rex at his place with his weapons and power, shows its opening panel and starts its script; TutorPanels $9810 counts the passes (TutorFrame $6083) and at fixed frames opens a panel of TutorTexts $A431 (TutorPanel: the screen saved, the boxed text, a fixed count, the screen back), changes the power or the weapon, switches the shield, drops a smart bomb, kills Rex or ends the room. After room 2 the credits and a new demo game. The random seed is reset at every room, so the demo is the same every time; SPACE pauses (DemoPause).
