$A4DB TextStandard ; REX STARTS WITH THE STANDARD ISSUE APA:150 MACHINE GUN ...
$A55C TextPower ; EACH WEAPON HAS A POWER STATUS FROM: PINK:LOW UP TO WHITE: HIGH ...
$A5E1 DoubleFireText ; the station's flag (0: not shown yet), then its panel: APA:150 MKII, A DUEL SHOT VERSION OF THE OLD APA MKI
