$E7FF ShotBufferOrigin ; the back buffer's origin for a bullet: $E7FF + 32 x y + x / 8
$E89F SparkleBufferOrigin ; the sparkle's origin
$E8FF SpriteBufferOrigin ; DrawSprite's origin
$E9FF ObjectBufferOrigin ; the objects' origin (the kill flash's start, MainLoop and ShowPoints)
$EAFF BufferPlayOrigin ; the play lines' origin (one byte before the buffer)
$EB00 BackBuffer ; the back buffer's play lines, 32 bytes a line, to $FFFF
